            <td class="lt-chem-151409" data-th="Prefixes">\(\kappa\)<sup>n</sup> where n is the number of attached atoms; used when the attached atoms are not directly connected by a chemical bond. The metal-ligand bonding usually involves \(\sigma\)-type coordination.</td>
