<p class="lt-chem-151409">with some examples taken from <a href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Courses/Saint_Marys_College_Notre_Dame_IN/CHEM_342%3A_Bio-inorganic_Chemistry/Readings/Week_2%3A_Introduction_to_Metal-Ligand_Interactions_and_Biomolecules/2.1_Transition_metal_complexes/2.1.6%3A_Naming_Transition_Metal_Complexes" rel="internal">Naming Transition Metal Complexes</a> by Kathryn Haas.</p>

